<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on CHF/DEM.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on CHF/DEM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on the Swiss franc/mark exchange rate, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   24.JAN.97	  LISTING   FFURT, DUSS</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  CHF/DEM 1.1575</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE   MATURITY     STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL   15.SEP.97    1.15 DEM   2.69 DEM  1.68 PCT  43.03 X</p>
<p> CALL   16.MAR.98    1.15 DEM   3.63 DEM  2.49 PCT  31.89 X</p>
<p> CALL   16.MAR.98    1.20 DEM   1.39 DEM  4.87 PCT  1.39 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
